patch 2:
1. Add power_on/power_off suggested in [2].
2. Add zero phy check in the driver.
patch 5:
1. Add K3 device description.
patch 6:
1. Update comments.

Changed from v4:
- https://lore.kernel.org/linux-pci/20260709040027.958400-1-inochiama@gmail.com/
patch 1:
